<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Experimental Setup</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix A Experimental Setup ‣ Mitigating Attention Localization in Small Scale: Self-Attention Refinement via One-step Belief Propagation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> and Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix A Experimental Setup ‣ Mitigating Attention Localization in Small Scale: Self-Attention Refinement via One-step Belief Propagation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> summarize the architectural specifications and training configurations of the models used in our experiments. We report details such as model size, number of training steps, learning rate schedules, and other relevant hyperparameters to ensure reproducibility and fair comparison across model variants. All reported accuracy metrics and plotted results are obtained using a fixed random seed of 42.</p>
</div>
