<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Detailed Model Performance on Glue</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Detailed results for the individual GLUE benchmarks are presented in Table <a href="#A4.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix D Detailed Model Performance on Glue ‣ Mitigating Attention Localization in Small Scale: Self-Attention Refinement via One-step Belief Propagation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>. While the best-performing variant differs slightly by task, BP-High delivers consistent, moderate improvements across the majority of benchmarks.</p>
</div>
